      "created_at": "2015-03-08T13:03:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, in addition to containing nifty scenarios, the scenario books have really nice-looking covers that I wouldn't mind displaying with the my other special comic books, all framed-up and pretty. It would be really neat if GtG offered extra scenario books for sale, or if they had art prints of the booklet covers.</p>\n<p>Is anyone else with me on that? Alternatively, is anyone aware of a reason that wouldn't be a feasible option?</p>\n<p>…I just want my theoretical signed copy of \"The Day Freedom Fell\" to stay in near-mint condition.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>",
